Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,the diagnosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.80,0:00:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,not useful
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.85,0:00:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,to make the
